* Mutant: 75 ohm terminations instead of 50 ohm. Fails the input termination impedance and input return loss,
* and with the larger input voltage the code tables.
.subckt ctle_28g vss vdd iref vocm vinp vinn gain_b0 gain_b1 peak_b0 peak_b1 voutp voutn
* bias: iref diode, cascoded tails
XREF iref iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XTP tp iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=120u l=0.5u ng=12
XTCP ep vcg tp vss sg13_lv_nmos w=60u l=0.13u ng=12
XTN tn iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=120u l=0.5u ng=12
XTCN en vcg tn vss sg13_lv_nmos w=60u l=0.13u ng=12
XBN xbn iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XBC pbd vocm xbn vss sg13_hv_nmos w=4u l=0.45u ng=1
XBPD pbd pbd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XBPM vbg pbd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
RSH vbg vocm 1k
CBG vbg vss 10p
XBPC vcg pbd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XCREP vcg vcg vcs vss sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1
RCB vcs vss 3k
CCG vcg vss 10p
* input
RTP vinp vocm 75
RTN vinn vocm 75
CCP vinp bp 2n
CCN vinn bn 2n
RBP bp vbg 5k
RBN bn vbg 5k
XQP cp bp ep vss npn13G2 Nx=8
XQN cn bn en vss npn13G2 Nx=8
LPP vddi xp 0.25n
RLP xp cp 45
LOP cp voutn 0.2n
LPN vddi xn 0.25n
RLN xn cn 45
LON cn voutp 0.2n
* gain bank
RS0 ep en 345
RG1A ep g1a 643
XG1A g1a gain_b1 g1b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
XG1B g1a gain_b0 g1b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
RG1B g1b en 643
RG2A ep g2a 491
XG2 g2a gain_b1 g2b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
RG2B g2b en 491
RG3A ep g3a 386
XG3A g3a gain_b1 g3m vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
XG3B g3m gain_b0 g3b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
RG3M g3m vss 1meg
RG3B g3b en 386
* peak bank: thermometer-decoded differential varactors; each well is driven by the inverted bit
* t1 = b0 or b1 (well = NOR), t2 = b1 (well = NOT b1), t3 = b0 and b1 (well = NAND)
XN1PA n1 peak_b0 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XN1PB w1 peak_b1 n1 vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
RN1 n1 vdd 1meg
XN1NA w1 peak_b0 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
XN1NB w1 peak_b1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
XI2P w2 peak_b1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XI2N w2 peak_b1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
XN3PA w3 peak_b0 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XN3PB w3 peak_b1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XN3NA w3 peak_b0 n3 vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
XN3NB n3 peak_b1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
RN3 n3 vss 1meg
RW1 w1 w1f 20k
RW2 w2 w2f 20k
RW3 w3 w3f 20k
CW1 w1f vss 1p
CW2 w2f vss 1p
CW3 w3f vss 1p
XV1 ep w1f en vss sg13_hv_svaricap w=9.74u l=0.8u nx=3
XV2 ep w2f en vss sg13_hv_svaricap w=9.74u l=0.8u nx=3
XV3 ep w3f en vss sg13_hv_svaricap w=9.74u l=0.8u nx=4
* CMFB
RCP voutp cms 10k
RCN voutn cms 10k
XE1 ea1 cms et vss sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XE2 ea2 vocm et vss sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XEP1 ea1 ea1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XEP2 ea2 ea1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XET et iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=4u l=0.5u ng=1
CCMP ea2 vdd 2p
XPASS vddi ea2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=200u l=0.4u ng=40 m=4
CVDDI vddi vss 20p
.ends ctle_28g
